      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": {
        "id": "Bandingkan ب, ت, dan ث dengan memperhatikan jumlah serta posisi titik.",
        "en": "Compare ب, ت, and ث by noticing the number and position of dots."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "block.arabic-letters-action-heading",
      "type": "heading",
